          "type": "quiz",
          "content": "Quiz",
          "x": 50,
          "y": 74.6875,
          "width": 20,
          "height": 10,
          "rotation": 0,
          "scale": 1,
          "metadata": {
            "fontFamily": "\"Fira Sans\"",
            "options": [
              "exponents",
              "× ÷ from left to right",
              "+ - from left to right",
              "final result"
            ],
            "correctIndex": 0,
            "correctIndices": [
              0
            ],
            "quizType": "reorder",
            "visualMode": false,
            "explanation": {
              "es": "Paso 1: Calcula primero todos los exponentes (potencias).\nPaso 2: Resuelve las multiplicaciones (×) y divisiones (÷) de izquierda a derecha.\nPaso 3: Resuelve las sumas (+) y restas (-) de izquierda a derecha.\nResultado: Llegas al resultado final de la expresión.\nConclusión: Los exponentes tienen mayor prioridad que la multiplicación y la división, las cuales a su vez van antes que la suma y la resta.",
              "en": "Step 1: Calculate all exponents (powers) first.\nStep 2: Solve all multiplications (×) and divisions (÷) from left to right.\nStep 3: Solve all additions (+) and subtractions (-) from left to right.\nResult: You reach the final result of the expression.\nConclusion: Exponents take precedence over multiplication and division, which in turn come before addition and subtraction."
            },
            "translations": {
              "en": {
                "explanation": "Step 1: Calculate all exponents (powers) first.\nStep 2: Solve all multiplications (×) and divisions (÷) from left to right.\nStep 3: Solve all additions (+) and subtractions (-) from left to right.\nResult: You reach the final result of the expression.\nConclusion: Exponents take precedence over multiplication and division, which in turn come before addition and subtraction."
              },
              "es": {
